{"sections":[{"slug":"Joyal模型结构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Joyal模型结构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Joyal <span lang=\"zh\">模型结构</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Joyal 模型结构”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Joyal <span lang=\"zh\">模型结构是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模型结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">弱等价是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的等价</span>,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">余纤维化为单射</span>,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">纤维性对象为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Lurie <span lang=\"zh\">的方法</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">先定义</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的模型结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">再通过</span> $\\mathfrak C\\colon\\mathsf {sSet}\\to\\mathsf {Cat}_{\\Delta}$ <span lang=\"zh\">转移</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们使用</span> Joyal <span lang=\"zh\">的方法</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">单纯集上的模型结构</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于单纯集的映射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">称之为范畴性等价</span> (categorical equivalence) <span lang=\"zh\">是指对任意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $Z$,\n$$\r\n\\pi_0(\\mathsf {Fun}(Y,Z)^\\simeq)\\to \\pi_0(\\mathsf {Fun}(X,Z)^\\simeq)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为双射</span>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>https://kerodon.net/tag/01E7</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这里所有单纯集都是余纤维性</span> (cofibrant) <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">内角形的嵌入</span> $\\Lambda_i^n\\to \\Delta^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">是范畴性等价</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">范畴性等价都是单纯集的弱同伦等价</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">恒等函子</span> $\\mathsf {sSet}^{\\text{Joyal}} \\to \\mathsf {sSet}^{\\text{Kan-Quillen}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Quillen伴随","text":"Quillen <span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">与单纯范畴上的模型结构的比较</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的函子</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为弱等价是指</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\pi_0 F$ <span lang=\"zh\">为等价</span>,</li>\n<li>$\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(x,y)\\to \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(Fx,Fy)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为弱同伦等价</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> (Lurie). <span lang=\"zh\">单纯范畴的范畴上存在一个模型结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中弱等价如上定义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">纤维性对象恰为</span> Hom <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan复形","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的单纯范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">存在如下伴随比较两个模型结构</span>.\n$$\r\n\\mathfrak C \\colon \\mathsf {sSet}^{\\text{Joyal}} \\leftrightarrows \\mathsf {Cat}_{\\Delta} \\colon \\mathfrak N\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathfrak C$ <span lang=\"zh\">由如下要求确定</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $\\mathfrak C[\\Delta^n]\\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $[n]\\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的模型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span> $\\mathfrak C[S]\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">同伦融贯交换图</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的模型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦融贯脉","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦融贯脉</span>"}},{"Plain":".)</p>\n"}]}}}]}